																		Thanks and spoilers.
															</div>
				<div class="info">
					<span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;"  ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1558990&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607071425" alt="Leveritas" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1558990)"/></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leveritas" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1558990); return false;" >Leveritas</a></span> <span class="odate time_1496747893 format_%25e%20%25b%20%25Y%2C%20%25H%3A%25M%7Cagohover">06 Jun 2017 11:18</span>
														</div>
			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-2843781">
									

<p>Special thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zachary-maxwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2975899); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2975899&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555339242" alt="Zachary Maxwell" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2975899)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/zachary-maxwell" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2975899); return false;">Zachary Maxwell</a></span> for the high-quality and in-depth feedback. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookypizza" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2260541); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2260541&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555339242" alt="SpookyPizza" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2260541)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/spookypizza" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2260541); return false;">SpookyPizza</a></span> also noted me on a massive potential plothole that was thankfully corrected. <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avagadro-catalyst" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3123362); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=3123362&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555339242" alt="avagadro_catalyst" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=3123362)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/avagadro-catalyst" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(3123362); return false;">avagadro_catalyst</a></span> helped me get the medication right along with Zachary.</p>
<div class="collapsible-block">
<div class="collapsible-block-folded"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">+&nbsp;Spoilers&nbsp;for&nbsp;the&nbsp;notes&nbsp;</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded" style="display:none">
<div class="collapsible-block-unfolded-link"><a class="collapsible-block-link" href="javascript:;">-&nbsp;Close</a></div>
<div class="collapsible-block-content">
<blockquote>
<p><strong>05/06/200█:</strong> Termination request by Dr. Langford 05/06/200█: <em>Denied. Object does not pose risk to personnel under current containment procedures. ~ Site Director.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is where we start seeing the cracks on Dr. Langfords' psyche. She starts to pity SCP-3550 after extended therapy and lies to her Site Director about the risk of keeping SCP-3550 alive.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>06/06/200█:</strong> Termination request by Dr. Langford 06/06/200█: <em>Denied. ~ Dr. ███ - Senior Staff Ethics committee.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>She then tries to convince the higher-ups. Same result.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>07/06/200█:</strong> Prescription change to █████ by Dr. Langford: <em>Denied due to risk of lethal overdose. ~ Senior Medical staff.</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>Langford is a psychiatrist, which means that this was a very dangerous mistake. Or was it a mistake? Langford probably did know that the drugs could be lethal. She tried to take matters into her own hands.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>08/06/200█:</strong> Dr. Langford has been reassigned to another project by order of O5-█ and Site Overseer.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>The Site Overseer is onto her now. They know that Langford is too close to SCP-3550 emotionally and decide to remove her.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>09/06/200█:</strong> SCP-3550's mental condition has worsened severely. Attempts suicide around 0:23pm and has to be restrained by security personnel. No injuries. Security officer ████ requests reassignment. Request approved by Site Overseer.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>It's possible that SCP-3550 was aware of Langford trying to end her life and tries to end her own again when she learns that Langford isn't coming back. The plan seemed to have failed.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>09/06/200█:</strong> Dr. Langford requests to be returned to Site-42 for assignment at the earliest convenience to another object (SCP-████)on-site.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is where Langford is starting to get desperate. She's getting obsessed with SCP-3550 and attempts to return to Site-42 under a poor excuse of wanting to work with another object close by.</p>
<blockquote>
<p><strong>10/06/200█:</strong> <em>Dr. Langford has been administered Class-C Amnestics and will be reassigned off-site for the foreseeable future. She will be replaced by Dr. Rosetta effective immediately. ~ O5-█</em></p>
</blockquote>
<p>This is where O5 decides she's over the line. It's decided that her memories of SCP-3550 are to be forcefully removed.</p>
<p>Finally, the name 'Cancer of Passion' is a play on words on the term 'Crime of Passion'.</p>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Enjoy!</p>
<p>Edit: Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/labiosis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2993265); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2993265&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1555339242" alt="Labiosis" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2993265)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/labiosis" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2993265); return false;">Labiosis</a></span> for pointing out inconsistencies with the dates!</p>

